WEBVTT

00:13:27.853 --> 00:13:30.153
to think very fundamentally differently

00:13:30.153 --> 00:13:31.973
about the structure of business,

00:13:31.973 --> 00:13:35.427
and, at last, it makes strategy interesting again.

00:13:35.427 --> 00:13:38.240
Thank you.

00:13:38.240 --> 00:13:40.755
(Applause)